    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938840/extras/59adb97bc4d985020520572e50e1f2dd.avif?t=1752174180\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials 2 is a mesmerizing puzzle and exploration game that will challenge your mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game takes you on an unforgettable journey through an island-filled stunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >environment. Master the art of teleportation, time manipulation, and moving between</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alternate worlds to solve intricate puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938840/extras/cd1c4a4db75b94003ef8bbd3d7b4b3a4.avif?t=1752174180\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of new skills, such as time manipulation, moving between worlds,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >teleportation and gravity manipulation.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938840/extras/59adb97bc4d985020520572e50e1f2dd.avif?t=1752174180\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Trials 2 is a mesmerizing puzzle and exploration game that will challenge your mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game takes you on an unforgettable journey through an island-filled stunning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >environment. Master the art of teleportation, time manipulation, and moving between</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >alternate worlds to solve intricate puzzles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2938840/extras/cd1c4a4db75b94003ef8bbd3d7b4b3a4.avif?t=1752174180\" width=600 height=224 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of new skills, such as time manipulation, moving between worlds,  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >teleportation and gravity manipulation.</p>",
